---
// Four promises the site makes, each with a small looping drawing: a latency spike (problem
// first), a token bucket (see it move), a terminal (code that runs) and a checklist (interviews).
// The drawings are CSS-animated SVG; with reduced motion they show their final frame.
---

<ul class="tiles not-content">
  <li class="tile" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 0">
    <svg class="tile-art" viewBox="0 0 240 120" role="img" aria-label="A latency graph that runs flat, then spikes sharply.">
      <g class="t-axis">
        <path d="M14 104h214M14 104V12" />
      </g>
      <path class="t-limit" d="M14 44h214" />
      <polyline class="t-line" points="14,90 34,86 54,92 74,84 94,88 114,82 134,86 150,74 162,30 174,22 186,58 204,80 228,84" />
      <circle class="t-spike" cx="174" cy="22" r="6" />
      <text x="20" y="38" class="t-label">p99 budget</text>
    </svg>
    <h3>Problem first</h3>
    <p>Every mechanism exists because something hurt. Each page opens with that moment, so you know why before you learn how.</p>
  </li>

  <li class="tile" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 1">
    <svg class="tile-art" viewBox="0 0 240 120" role="img" aria-label="Tokens drop into a bucket one by one, and requests take them out.">
      <path class="t-bucket" d="M70 40v58a8 8 0 0 0 8 8h84a8 8 0 0 0 8-8V40" />
      <g class="t-tokens">
        <circle cx="96" cy="94" r="8" />
        <circle cx="120" cy="94" r="8" />
        <circle cx="144" cy="94" r="8" />
        <circle cx="108" cy="76" r="8" />
        <circle cx="132" cy="76" r="8" />
      </g>
      <circle class="t-drop" cx="120" cy="14" r="8" />
      <circle class="t-take" cx="190" cy="94" r="8" />
      <text x="178" y="38" class="t-label">5 / s</text>
    </svg>
    <h3>See it move</h3>
    <p>Diagrams show the structure. Simulations let you change the numbers and watch queues fill, tokens drain and replicas fall behind.</p>
  </li>

  <li class="tile" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 2">
    <svg class="tile-art" viewBox="0 0 240 120" role="img" aria-label="A terminal running an example and printing its timings.">
      <rect class="t-term" x="10" y="8" width="220" height="104" rx="8" />
      <circle cx="26" cy="22" r="4" class="t-dot-r" />
      <circle cx="40" cy="22" r="4" class="t-dot-a" />
      <circle cx="54" cy="22" r="4" class="t-dot-g" />
      <g class="t-code">
        <text x="22" y="52" class="t-type t-type-1">$ python by_hand.py</text>
        <text x="22" y="74" class="t-type t-type-2">dns     40 ms</text>
        <text x="22" y="96" class="t-type t-type-3">tls     24 ms  ok</text>
      </g>
      <rect class="t-caret" x="22" y="84" width="9" height="16" />
    </svg>
    <h3>Code that runs</h3>
    <p>Every snippet comes in Python and JavaScript, grows from naive to production-shaped, and has a runnable twin in the repository.</p>
  </li>

  <li class="tile" data-reveal style="--reveal-i: 3">
    <svg class="tile-art" viewBox="0 0 240 120" role="img" aria-label="An interview checklist with three items ticked one after another.">
      {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
        <g>
          <rect class="t-box" x="22" y={16 + i * 34} width="22" height="22" rx="5" />
          <path class={`t-tick t-tick-${i}`} d={`M27 ${27 + i * 34}l5 5 9-10`} pathLength="1" />
          <path class="t-rule" d={`M58 ${27 + i * 34}h${[150, 120, 160][i]}`} />
        </g>
      ))}
    </svg>
    <h3>Ready for interviews</h3>
    <p>Each topic ends with typical interview questions, what a strong answer covers, and a short self-check with hidden answers.</p>
  </li>
</ul>

<style>
  .tiles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 15rem), 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .tile {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline-shade);
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--note-paper-raised);
    box-shadow: var(--note-shadow);
    transition: translate 0.3s var(--note-ease), border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .tile:hover {
    translate: 0 -3px;
    border-color: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
  }
  .tile h3 {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--note-font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }
  .tile p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  .tile-art {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--note-grid) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 16px 16px,
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--note-grid) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0 / 16px 16px,
      var(--viz-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
  }
  .t-label {
    font-family: var(--note-font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 15px;
    fill: var(--viz-muted);
  }

  /* 1. Latency spike */
  .t-axis path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--viz-stroke);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .t-limit {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--viz-bad);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .t-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--viz-flow);
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 260;
  }
  .t-spike {
    fill: var(--viz-bad);
  }

  /* 2. Token bucket */
  .t-bucket {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--viz-ink);
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }
  .t-tokens circle,
  .t-drop {
    fill: var(--viz-ok);
  }
  .t-take {
    fill: var(--viz-flow);
  }

  /* 3. Terminal */
  .t-term {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--viz-ink) 6%, var(--viz-surface));
    stroke: var(--viz-stroke);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .t-dot-r { fill: var(--viz-bad); }
  .t-dot-a { fill: var(--viz-warn); }
  .t-dot-g { fill: var(--viz-ok); }
  .t-code text {
    font-family: var(--sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 15px;
    fill: var(--viz-ink);
  }
  .t-type-1 { fill: var(--viz-flow) !important; }
  .t-caret {
    fill: var(--viz-ink);
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* 4. Checklist */
  .t-box {
    fill: var(--viz-surface);
    stroke: var(--viz-stroke);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .t-tick {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--viz-ok);
    stroke-width: 3.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .t-rule {
    stroke: var(--viz-stroke);
    stroke-width: 6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .t-line {
      animation: t-draw 4s var(--note-ease) infinite;
    }
    .t-spike {
      animation: t-pop 4s ease-out infinite;
    }
    .t-drop {
      animation: t-drop 2.4s cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.75, 0) infinite;
    }
    .t-take {
      animation: t-take 2.4s 1.2s var(--note-ease) infinite both;
    }
    .t-type {
      clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0);
      animation: t-type 6s steps(22, end) infinite;
    }
    .t-type-2 {
      animation-name: t-type-2;
    }
    .t-type-3 {
      animation-name: t-type-3;
    }
    .t-caret {
      animation: t-caret 1s steps(1) infinite;
    }
    .t-tick {
      stroke-dasharray: 1;
      animation: t-tick 4.5s var(--note-ease) infinite;
    }
    .t-tick-1 { animation-delay: 0.45s; }
    .t-tick-2 { animation-delay: 0.9s; }
  }

  @keyframes t-draw {
    0% { stroke-dashoffset: 260; }
    55%, 100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes t-pop {
    0%, 38% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.3); transform-origin: 174px 22px; }
    46% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.5); transform-origin: 174px 22px; }
    54%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); transform-origin: 174px 22px; }
  }
  @keyframes t-drop {
    0% { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0; }
    15% { opacity: 1; }
    70%, 100% { transform: translateY(44px); opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes t-take {
    0% { transform: translateX(-52px); opacity: 0; }
    20% { opacity: 1; }
    60% { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: translateX(30px); opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes t-type {
    0% { clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0); }
    20%, 100% { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); }
  }
  @keyframes t-type-2 {
    0%, 30% { clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0); }
    45%, 100% { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); }
  }
  @keyframes t-type-3 {
    0%, 52% { clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0); }
    68%, 100% { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); }
  }
  @keyframes t-caret {
    50% { opacity: 1; }
  }
  @keyframes t-tick {
    0%, 8% { stroke-dashoffset: 1; }
    25%, 85% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    100% { stroke-dashoffset: 1; }
  }
</style>
